         <div type="bio">
            <p>Irish novelist, born Brian Oswald Donn-Byrne. Though he spent much of his adult life in the United States, his fiction is set mostly in Ireland and evokes Irish history. He died relatively young in an automobile accident in Ireland. <hi rend="bold">William Brockman</hi>
